						<r3d:remarks>NSF Arctic Data Center is covered by Clarivate Data Citation Index . The NSF Arctic Data Center will support this community with the release of a user-friendly, data-sharing platform built on an open-source search application developed at NCEAS, and used by multiple repositories and networks, including the KNB Data Repository, DataONE, and the Gulf of Alaska Data Portal. Data and metadata from ACADIS, the current platform supporting NSF Arctic research data, are currently being ingested into the NSF Arctic Data Center
NSF Arctic Data Center was CTS certified until 2023-03-27.</r3d:remarks>
